      "updated": 1791863220052,
      "created": 1791859001060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "点击战斗icon进入战斗小\n地图A5时，A3区幕布式\n上拉升起，战斗结束后\nA3区落下【动效】。\n\n点击事件icon打开事件窗\n口A4",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "0O6GeKNuM19T4JOX9w-or",
      "originalText": "点击战斗icon进入战斗小地图A5时，A3区幕布式上拉升起，战斗结束后A3区落下【动效】。\n\n点击事件icon打开事件窗口A4",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2FlY_iFl11z-ITG_gF9qk",
