    },
    {
      "id": "sXF66TFN5aDhpRoC1Do--",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1914.3018717241494,
      "y": 1485.0158172048252,
      "width": 216,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2038568491,
      "version": 441,
      "versionNonce": 1369424171,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791862360489,
      "created": 1791861142742,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C3区存在奇物与符文两个\n页签，都是以折叠纸的形式\n出现，打开收起的动态效果\n为拉出。\n\n其中E2区用来放置奇物，\n可以直接拖动到召唤阵中。\nE1区用来放置符文，参考\n已知符文来绘画。\n\n事件中获得的符文与奇物会\n自动加入这两个区域",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "7negabmb8bxr0yITJKEIc",
      "originalText": "C3区存在奇物与符文两个页签，都是以折叠纸的形式出现，打开收起的动态效果为拉出。\n\n其中E2区用来放置奇物，可以直接拖动到召唤阵中。E1区用来放置符文，参考已知符文来绘画。\n\n事件中获得的符文与奇物会自动加入这两个区域",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ddEyifFQLoJr_cV5u0n2G",
      "type": "stickynote",
