      "seed": 2022301669,
      "version": 228,
      "versionNonce": 56689867,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791864299618,
      "created": 1791863574018,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "E区负责进入当前场景，\n在召唤阵中央汇聚一个\n魔力蛹，随后炸开召唤\n出怪物【动效】\n\n随后需要依次弹出召唤\n出来的怪物",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "q4gAw0xDHTPowboojDDkq",
      "originalText": "E区负责进入当前场景，在召唤阵中央汇聚一个魔力蛹，随后炸开召唤出怪物【动效】\n\n随后需要依次弹出召唤出来的怪物",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
