    {
      "id": "2Na-XkC-9LPOmUkmrIixA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2596.050836391369,
      "y": 2025.9029095618434,
      "width": 209.59999084472656,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8Ct",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2092200203,
      "version": 255,
      "versionNonce": 529893541,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791862883799,
      "created": 1791862537895,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "D2区需要能够通过右侧\n的标签页快速勾选，筛\n选需要的怪物。怪物将\n以便条的形式，支持仓\n库上下滑动。\n\n另外，回收怪物会直接\n在仓库界面中撕掉怪物\n便条【动效】",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "xFh1PlRCodQFRdMIRhJ-Z",
      "originalText": "D2区需要能够通过右侧的标签页快速勾选，筛选需要的怪物。怪物将以便条的形式，支持仓库上下滑动。\n\n另外，回收怪物会直接在仓库界面中撕掉怪物便条【动效】",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
